  "details": "at least ones like the hearts and thumbs up. these were used when people were on stage and everyone loved to show love by showering them with hearts. most of the emoji, at the moment, stay way too close it seems. \n\nthey also seems to originate from really low, almost the crotch area, which is a bit weird\n\nedit 1: the \"shape\" seems to be too random and big, for instance, the sleeping Zzz seemed to have come from my knees\n\nedit 2: the particles seem to be spawning from your head in the direction you look. might be a nice way to control where you come from knowing that\n",
